{
  "title": "Nutty Mild Dutch Red Pepper Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting vegan stew featuring red pepper paste, perfect for a lazy Sunday, with earthy and light flavors. This dish is a classic Dutch-inspired recipe with a twist.",
